{"id":"1557fc2f1143cf1d","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-thresholdrestriction.md","title":"Separating structures under coordinate restriction","display":"thm-thresholdrestriction — Separating structures under coordinate restriction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-thresholdrestriction","aliases":["27-thm-thresholdrestriction"],"display":"thm-thresholdrestriction — Separating structures under coordinate restriction","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.2 Theorem 9.3","source_printed_pages":"408","source_pdf_pages":"432","verification_status":"source-statement-and-substitution-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-thresholdrestriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-thresholdrestriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thresholdrestriction — Separating structures under coordinate restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Theorem 9.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"408"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"432"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-substitution-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\">\\((w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat w^{(i)}\\in\\mathbb R^{n-1}\">\\(\\widehat w^{(i)}\\in\\mathbb R^{n-1}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat w^{(i)}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&amp;1\\le j&lt;i,\\\\w_{j+1}&amp;i\\le j\\le n-1\\end{cases}\\quad(j\\in[n-1]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat w^{(i)}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&amp;1\\le j&lt;i,\\\\w_{j+1}&amp;i\\le j\\le n-1\\end{cases}\\quad(j\\in[n-1]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad (\\iota_{i,b}(y))_k\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y_k&amp;1\\le k&lt;i,\\\\b&amp;k=i,\\\\y_{k-1}&amp;i&lt;k\\le n.\\end{cases}\\quad(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1},\\ k\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad (\\iota_{i,b}(y))_k\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y_k&amp;1\\le k&lt;i,\\\\b&amp;k=i,\\\\y_{k-1}&amp;i&lt;k\\le n.\\end{cases}\\quad(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1},\\ k\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_{i,b}\\coloneqq\\{(y,f(\\iota_{i,b}(y)))\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_{i,b}\\coloneqq\\{(y,f(\\iota_{i,b}(y)))\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\widehat w^{(i)},t-bw_i)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f_{i,b}),\\qquad f_{i,b}\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_{n-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\widehat w^{(i)},t-bw_i)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f_{i,b}),\\qquad f_{i,b}\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_{n-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.3，印刷 p.408／PDF p.432。把固定坐标贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bw_i\">\\(bw_i\\)</span> 移至阈值即可；严格真侧与非严格假侧均保持。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 得零元常函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]；$i\\in[n]$，$b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$。$y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}$；$\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n$ 与 $\\widehat w^{(i)}\\in\\mathbb R^{n-1}$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat w^{(i)}\\in\\mathbb R^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat w^{(i)}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&1\\le j<i,\\\\w_{j+1}&i\\le j\\le n-1\\end{cases}\\quad(j\\in[n-1]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_{i,b}:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad (\\iota_{i,b}(y))_k\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}y_k&1\\le k<i,\\\\b&k=i,\\\\y_{k-1}&i<k\\le n.\\end{cases}\\quad(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1},\\ k\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"f_{i,b}\\coloneqq\\{(y,f(\\iota_{i,b}(y)))\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\widehat w^{(i)},t-bw_i)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f_{i,b}),\\qquad f_{i,b}\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_{n-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"bw_i","display":false},{"tex":"n=1","display":false}],"bytes":1697,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholdrestriction|thm-thresholdrestriction — Separating structures under coordinate restriction]]"},{"id":"b345ddaf3d56d017","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$，$y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}$；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$，向量按坐标集上的函数图表示。$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n,\\mathrm{Sep}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$f^d:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 与 $H:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式构造。整数表示存在性、对偶结构与限制结构分别见 [[27-thm-threshweight]]、[[27-thm-thresholddual]]、[[27-thm-thresholdrestriction]]。"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5"]}